cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these scripts or derived tables, please cite this work."
title: "Polygenic signals of climate adaptation in a globally invasive pest, the fall armyworm (Spodoptera frugiperda)"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data accompanying a study of climate adaptation in
  the fall armyworm, based on a public resequencing panel of 214 individuals
  from 12 countries across six study accessions.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hu
    given-names: Wenchao
version: "v2"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
keywords:
  - landscape genomics
  - genotype-environment association
  - Spodoptera frugiperda
  - invasive species
  - partial redundancy analysis
  - reference bias
